sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Пользователь
    participant P as Presentation
    participant C as Control
    participant M as Mediator
    participant F as Foundation
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>P: POST /api/bookings
    P->>C: DTO + validation
    C->>M: create(user, room, interval)
    M->>F: check overlapping bookings
    F->>DB: SELECT bookings
    DB-->>F: existing intervals
    F-->>M: conflict/no conflict
    alt conflict
        M-->>P: 409 Conflict
    else free
        M->>F: save Booking
        F->>DB: INSERT
        DB-->>F: saved row
        F-->>M: Booking
        M-->>P: 201 Created
    end
    P-->>U: result
